---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import skiing from "../assets/images/photo3.jpg";
import experiences from "../collections/experiences.json";
import social from "../collections/social.json";
import AboutExperience from "../components/about-experience.astro";
import Button from "../components/button.astro";
import PageHeading from "../components/page-heading.astro";
import SocialIcon from "../components/social-icon.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/main.astro";

type IconName = "mail" | "linkedin" | "github" | "x" | "instagram";
const RESUME_URL = "/OriolSubirana2026-SWE.pdf";
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Who Oriol Subirana is: a software engineer lead in Zürich, his career from Accenture to enterprise AI at NatWest, and life on two wheels in the Swiss Alps."
>
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6 pb-8 pt-14 md:pt-20">
    <PageHeading
      title="About me"
      description="I'm Oriol Subirana, a software engineer lead based in Zürich, Switzerland. I've spent the last ten years designing and shipping large-scale cloud systems, from hands-on work in Java, Kotlin and Spring to leading cross-functional engineering teams. I care about clean architecture, a healthy DevOps culture, and building products that matter."
    />
  </div>

  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6">
    <Image
      src={skiing}
      alt="Oriol on skis at the top of a run in the Swiss Alps, looking out over cloud-covered valleys"
      widths={[640, 1024, 1536, 2048]}
      sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 64rem, 100vw"
      class="aspect-[16/9] w-full rounded-3xl object-cover"
    />
  </div>

  <section
    aria-labelledby="bio-heading"
    class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-5xl gap-6 px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:gap-8 md:py-20"
  >
    <h2
      id="bio-heading"
      class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50"
    >
      Off the keyboard
    </h2>
    <div class="max-w-prose space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
      <p>
        When I'm not writing code, you'll most likely find me on two wheels.
        Road cycling is a big part of my life: long summer rides through the
        Swiss Alps, chasing cols and pushing my limits on every climb. It's how
        I clear my head and explore new places.
      </p>
      <p>
        Beyond the bike, I've played basketball since childhood, I catch small
        waves when the surf is right, and since moving to Switzerland skiing
        has become a winter staple. I'm also a bit of a car enthusiast. Porsche
        and Mini are my favourites, and a classic Mini Cooper and a 993 are
        still very much on the dream list.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    aria-labelledby="ai-heading"
    class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-5xl gap-6 px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:gap-8 md:py-20"
    >
      <h2
        id="ai-heading"
        class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50"
      >
        Working with AI
      </h2>
      <div class="max-w-prose space-y-5 text-base leading-7 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
        <p>
          Since 2025 I work on the platform behind an enterprise AI system at a
          bank: the distributed services that feed retrieval-augmented
          generation, connect large language models to internal data, and keep
          everything auditable enough for a regulated environment. The
          interesting problems are rarely the model. They are latency, cost,
          evaluation, and what happens when the answer is wrong.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside work I use AI coding agents daily and build small pipelines
          that chain models together, from script to speech to rendered video.
          It has changed how I write software: more time on architecture,
          tests and review, less on typing.
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 pt-1">
          {
            [
              "RAG architectures",
              "LLM integration",
              "Vector search",
              "Agentic workflows",
              "Evaluation and guardrails",
              "AI coding agents",
            ].map((item) => (
              <li class="rounded-full border border-stone-200 px-3 py-1 text-sm text-stone-700 dark:border-stone-800 dark:text-stone-300">
                {item}
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    aria-labelledby="experience-heading"
    class="border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-5xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <h2
          id="experience-heading"
          class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50"
        >
          Experience
        </h2>
        <Button text="Read my résumé" link={RESUME_URL} variant="secondary" external />
      </div>

      <ol class="mt-12">
        {
          experiences.map((experience, index) => (
            <AboutExperience
              start={experience.start}
              end={experience.end}
              role={experience.role}
              company={experience.company}
              description={experience.description}
              logo={experience.logo}
              last={index === experiences.length - 1}
            />
          ))
        }
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section
    id="connect"
    aria-labelledby="connect-heading"
    class="scroll-mt-16 border-t border-stone-200 dark:border-stone-800"
  >
    <div
      class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-5xl gap-8 px-6 py-16 md:grid-cols-[1fr_2fr] md:py-20"
    >
      <h2
        id="connect-heading"
        class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-50"
      >
        Let's connect
      </h2>
      <div>
        <p class="max-w-prose text-base leading-7 text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400">
          Send me an email and I'll get back to you. For everything else,
          you'll find me here:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 divide-y divide-stone-200 border-y border-stone-200 dark:divide-stone-800 dark:border-stone-800">
          {
            social.map((item) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={item.url}
                  target={item.url.startsWith("http") ? "_blank" : undefined}
                  rel={item.url.startsWith("http") ? "noopener noreferrer" : undefined}
                  class="group flex items-center gap-4 py-3.5 text-stone-700 transition-colors hover:text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-300 dark:hover:text-stone-50"
                >
                  <SocialIcon name={item.icon as IconName} class="h-5 w-5 text-stone-400 transition-colors group-hover:text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-500 dark:group-hover:text-stone-100" />
                  <span class="w-24 text-sm font-medium">{item.name}</span>
                  <span class="truncate text-sm text-stone-500 dark:text-stone-400">{item.handle}</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
